    "description": "What: On demo-city, with SUMO background traffic (the traffic settings: 600 cars, seed 1), four APCs ('Escort 1'..'Escort 4') drive as a road convoy south down the three-lane avenue (SUMO edge e_axis_n_drop_d_3_6) in live SUMO traffic: 'Escort 1' handed to SUMO without a beacon (ConvoyOrder, Mode Traffic) at 9 m/s, the others on its path 15 m apart, to (145.2, 975) — short of the lit junction d_3_6. SUMO's faster cars overtake in the other lanes; each gap in the column is told to SUMO as an obstacle (C-5), so no car cuts into it. Judge: (1) the lead runs PlatformConvoy and is handed to SUMO; (2) traffic comes close to the column (else the next rows prove nothing); (3) no SUMO car is ever in a gap between two convoy vehicles (a corridor of half a lane, so a car alongside in the next lane does not count); (4) the column never splits; (5) the lead reaches its destination. Check: scripts/scenario-regression.sh cv-no-cut-in"
  },
